{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28006","headline":"闲居即事 · 朱庆余","name":"闲居即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深嶂多幽景，闲居野兴清。\n满庭秋雨过，连夜绿苔生。\n石面横琴坐，松阴采药行。\n超然尘事外，不似绊浮名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}